utton (Trigger): press and hold - move forward, double fast click - shoot.\n\nBibliography:\nA. Cookson, R. DowlingSoka, C. Crumpler, Unreal Engine 4 Game Development in 24 Hours, Pearson Education, Inc. 2016.", "short_description": "The goal of the game is to shoot down as many asteroids as possible. Press and hold (Trigger) - move forward, double fast click (Trigger) - shoot."}]}, "developer_name": "dbor02", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://sites.google.com/view/dbor02dotka/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "dbor02", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dbor02dotka/home", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dbor02dotka/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "654407292475440"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974584_1367164280115809_7598373926372114432_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kLIWRtuPYwkQ7kNvwF32L0n&_nc_oc=Adr_piUj3aGkA4WsfCK6Wc2agSgSxJs-H06E9L2rSN1O5mF5hudMWOtyQZ8Y_ZDBQYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQkQYsInI83PoGE10n1i5QyjynS3usL0i1muIHzGXdpZQ&oe=6B0C74C5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Dotka", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1575568856, "lastRevision"